(# CollabSpace Frontend Full Explanation Guide) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(This guide explains the whole frontend codebase file by file, with architecture flow, syntax) Tj
T*(meaning, and visual understanding.) Tj
T*(Backend is intentionally excluded based on your request.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(---) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(## 1\) Big Picture: What This Frontend Does) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(This frontend is a React + TypeScript + Vite SPA for multi-tenant project collaboration:) Tj
T*(- Authentication \(login/register\)) Tj
T*(- Organization management) Tj
T*(- Member/role management) Tj
T*(- Project management) Tj
T*(- Kanban board \(task drag/drop by status\)) Tj
T*(- Task detail with comments, activity, assignment history) Tj
T*(- Tag management) Tj
T*(- Light/dark theme support) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### Runtime visual flow) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(```text) Tj
T*(Browser loads index.html) Tj
T*(  -> src/main.tsx mounts React app) Tj
T*(    -> Providers wrap app:) Tj
T*(       ColorModeProvider -> AuthProvider -> ThemedApp) Tj
T*(         -> ConfigProvider \(Ant theme by mode\)) Tj
T*(           -> RouterProvider \(all routes\)) Tj
T*(             -> ProtectedRoute gates private routes) Tj
T*(               -> AppShell layout) Tj
T*(                 -> Page components) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### Data flow visual) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(```text) Tj
T*(UI action \(button/form\)) Tj
T*(  -> Page component handler) Tj
T*(    -> Service call \(axios\)) Tj
T*(      -> Backend API) Tj
T*(        -> ApiResponse<T>) Tj
T*(      <- Result) Tj
T*(    -> setState/useEffect refresh) Tj
T*(  -> UI rerender) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(---) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(## 2\) Tech Stack and Why It Matters) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(- React 19 + TypeScript: component logic + type safety) Tj
T*(- Vite: fast dev server and build) Tj
T*(- React Router v7: client-side route tree) Tj
T*ET
endstream
endobj
