(- Ant Design: ready-made UI components) Tj
T*(- Tailwind v4: utility class styling \(including `important` suffix style like `text-sm!`\)) Tj
T*(- Axios: HTTP client with interceptors) Tj
T*(- ESLint + hooks/refresh rules: code quality and safe Fast Refresh) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(---) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(## 3\) Root-Level Files \(Frontend Root\)) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `package.json`) Tj
T*(- Defines scripts: `dev`, `build`, `lint`, `preview`) Tj
T*(- Dependencies include React, Router, AntD, Axios, Tailwind Vite plugin) Tj
T*(- This is where build and lint behavior starts.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `package-lock.json`) Tj
T*(- Auto-generated dependency lock.) Tj
T*(- Ensures exact package versions for consistent install.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `vite.config.ts`) Tj
T*(- Registers plugins:) Tj
T*(  - `@vitejs/plugin-react`) Tj
T*(  - `@tailwindcss/vite`) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `eslint.config.js`) Tj
T*(- Enables:) Tj
T*(  - JS recommended rules) Tj
T*(  - TypeScript ESLint recommended rules) Tj
T*(  - React hooks rules) Tj
T*(  - React refresh \(Vite\) rules) Tj
T*(- Important for warnings you recently fixed.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `tsconfig.json`, `tsconfig.app.json`, `tsconfig.node.json`) Tj
T*(- Project references and compiler options.) Tj
T*(- App config includes DOM libs and JSX mode.) Tj
T*(- Node config covers Vite config typing.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `index.html`) Tj
T*(- Single root element `<div id="root"></div>`) Tj
T*(- Boot script points to `/src/main.tsx`.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `.gitignore`) Tj
T*(- Standard ignore behavior for node, build artifacts, etc.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `README.md`) Tj
T*(- Vite template README \(not project-specific docs\).) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(---) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(## 4\) `src/` Top-Level Files) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `src/main.tsx`) Tj
T*(Main entry point:) Tj
T*(- Gets theme mode from `useColorMode\(\)`) Tj
T*(- Applies Ant Design theme through `ConfigProvider`) Tj
T*ET
endstream
