T*(- Uses singleton root pattern to avoid duplicate `createRoot` warnings in HMR:) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(```tsx) Tj
T*(const root = windowWithRoot.__collabspaceRoot__ ?? createRoot\(container\);) Tj
T*(windowWithRoot.__collabspaceRoot__ = root;) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `src/App.tsx`) Tj
T*(- Minimal route shell returning `<Outlet />`) Tj
T*(- Used as top route parent.) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `src/index.css`) Tj
T*(Global styling system:) Tj
T*(- Tailwind import: `@import "tailwindcss";`) Tj
T*(- CSS variables for light/dark theme \(`--surface`, `--ink`, `--primary`, etc.\)) Tj
T*(- Sidebar/topbar card styles) Tj
T*(- Utility classes for repeated layout blocks \(`compact-list`, `compact-metric`, etc.\)) Tj
T*(- This file defines most of the app visual identity.) Tj
T*() Tj
