T*() Tj
T*(## 5\) App Setup Layer \(`src/app`\)) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `src/app/router.tsx`) Tj
T*(Defines full route tree:) Tj
T*(- Public: `/login`, `/register`) Tj
T*(- Protected \(inside `ProtectedRoute` + `AppShell`\):) Tj
T*(  - `/dashboard`) Tj
T*(  - `/organizations`, `/organizations/:organizationId`, `/organizations/:organizationId/members`) Tj
T*(  - `/projects`, `/projects/:projectId`, `/projects/:projectId/board`) Tj
T*(  - `/board` \(redirect page\)) Tj
T*(  - `/tasks/:taskId`) Tj
T*(  - `/tags`) Tj
T*(  - `/settings`) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `src/app/theme.ts`) Tj
T*(Function `getAppTheme\(mode\)` returns Ant theme config:) Tj
T*(- Switches `theme.darkAlgorithm` vs default) Tj
T*(- Custom tokens: colors, fonts, radius, shadows) Tj
T*(- Component-level tokens for Button/Card/Input) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(---) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(## 6\) Hooks Layer \(`src/hooks`\)) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(### `src/hooks/use-color-mode.tsx`) Tj
T*(Color mode context/provider:) Tj
T*(- Mode type: `'light' | 'dark'`) Tj
T*(- Persists mode in localStorage key `collabspace_color_mode`) Tj
T*(- Applies mode to `document.documentElement.dataset.theme`) Tj
T*(- Exposes:) Tj
T*(  - `mode`) Tj
T*ET
endstream
