T*(## 13\) Important Syntax Patterns You Should Explain in GD) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(1. React context provider + custom hook guard:) Tj
T*(```ts) Tj
T*(const context = useContext\(AuthContext\);) Tj
T*(if \(!context\) throw new Error\(...\);) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(2. API typing with generics:) Tj
T*(```ts) Tj
T*(apiClient.get<ApiResponse<Project[]>>\(...\)) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(3. Conditional route guard:) Tj
T*(```tsx) Tj
T*(if \(!user\) return <Navigate to="/login" replace />;) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(4. useEffect bootstrap pattern:) Tj
T*(```ts) Tj
T*(const hasBootstrappedRef = useRef\(false\);) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(5. Memoized loaders with `useCallback` for lint-safe dependencies:) Tj
T*(```ts) Tj
T*(const loadData = useCallback\(async \(\) => {...}, [deps]\);) Tj
T*(useEffect\(\(\) => { void loadData\(\); }, [loadData]\);) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(6. AntD modal confirm for destructive actions:) Tj
T*(```ts) Tj
T*(modal.confirm\({ title, onOk: async \(\) => await removeX\(\) }\);) Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(7. Tailwind v4 important suffix style:) Tj
T*(```tsx) Tj
T*(className="text-slate-500!") Tj
T*(```) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(---) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(## 14\) End-to-End User Journey \(Mentor-Friendly Story\)) Tj
T*() Tj
T*(1. User opens app -> `main.tsx` mounts providers + router.) Tj
T*(2. AuthProvider checks token:) Tj
T*(   - if token valid -> fetch `/auth/me` and open private area) Tj
T*(   - else -> redirect to login) Tj
T*(3. After login:) Tj
T*(   - token saved) Tj
T*(   - active organization selected) Tj
T*(   - AppShell appears) Tj
T*(4. User manages organizations/projects/members/tags) Tj
T*(5. User opens board:) Tj
T*ET
endstream
endobj
